HE_MEM_ID_WIDTH=7\nCONF_HPDCACHE_MEM_DATA_WIDTH=512\nCONF_HPDCACHE_WT_ENABLE=1\nCONF_HPDCACHE_WB_ENABLE=1\nCONF_HPDCACHE_LOW_LATENCY=0"
